<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46126" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζά̆μεν-ζε</span></b> , inseparable Suffix, denoting <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>motion
			towards</i>:—prop. representing <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-σδε</span>, as in <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀθήναζε,
				Θήβαζε, θύραζε</span> for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀθήνασδε, Θήβασδε, θύρασδε</span>: but sts. found with
			sg. Nouns, as <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔραζε, χαμᾶζε, Ὀλυμπίαζε,
				Μουνυχίαζε</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Adv.</u>
				194.18
			</span></i>.</div>
